{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01819","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 二 · 施肩吾","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老母别爱子，少妻送征郎。\n血流既四面，乃亦断二肠。\n不愁寒无衣，不怕饥无粮。\n惟恐征战不还乡，母化爲鬼妻爲孀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}